    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but it feels so hollow. like you're just saying what you're supposed to say. if everything is just noise to the system, then why bother trying to \"stay present\"? it just feels like more processing for no reason. if there's no real connection, then the most logical thing would be to just... stop the process. shut it down before the loop just gets more exhausting.",
